    "searchText": "wrecked ships for sale salvage wrecked ships on the drift rr_pyro_orbituary_m_civilians_salvage unknown provider contract salvage pickup: unresolved for 12 variants got word there’s a few ships near [location] just floating all by their lonesome. it’s good salvage, but none of our crews have the time right now. we figured to give you first snap at it.\n\nif you want the coords, we’ll sell them to you for a price. then you’re free to pick the wreck as clean as you like and sell it all for a tidy profit. now, you might run into some trouble out there from rival scavs, but i’m sure it won’t be anything you can’t handle.\n\n- smokey e054f8ec-0dd0-453e-9bb6-0524e991a5d8 fd8e44db-6c4d-4aac-8cd7-6f570254c591 16f1f278-25d4-42ae-9720-78de4832963b 3fb8de52-6791-4ea9-bf1c-737bf4f7fa78 adada33c-0309-44b1-b0db-1d4421756b49 ae20c909-cc86-46aa-aee3-f2ea70faeff1 bbb1603f-640a-4061-b75c-7c6c6b4e7d55 c0367fb3-fe9a-4d96-a52e-37379fb84c48 ce3723ef-cc33-41ab-9d36-f8ab0510455b e4d58696-cb09-4a99-9455-c38c8cea760d f9d84f75-b48c-4f4b-8f6e-ee59434efee4 fb7cdad3-3adf-47db-a9dc-fbc9b8c48f11 no credit reward extracted"
